Output docs/assets/demo.gif

Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 18
Set Width 1000
Set Height 480
Set Theme "Dracula"
Set Padding 20
Set TypingSpeed 60ms

Type "# lint_cv a CV draft against your own configurable rules"
Enter
Sleep 800ms
Type ".venv/bin/python docs/assets/demo_lint.py"
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 4500ms
